module.exports = /*#__PURE__*/JSON.parse('{"title":"5 Ways to Make Your App Popular with Shared-State","description":"Users do not quit because your app is bad — they quit because the chain experience gets in the way. Here are 5 ways Shared-State removes that friction and makes your app grow.","frontMatter":{"slug":"5-ways-to-make-your-app-popular","title":"5 Ways to Make Your App Popular with Shared-State","authors":["push"],"image":"./cover-image.webp","description":"Users do not quit because your app is bad — they quit because the chain experience gets in the way. Here are 5 ways Shared-State removes that friction and makes your app grow.","text":"Users don\'t quit bad apps. They quit because wallet switches, mismatched balances, and endless approvals get in the way. Shared-State removes those blockers. Here are 5 concrete ways it makes your app feel seamless — and grow.","tags":["Thought Leadership","Key Features"]},"content":{"id":"5-ways-to-make-your-app-popular","metadata":{"permalink":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1218/blog/5-ways-to-make-your-app-popular","source":"@site/blog/2026-02-08-5-ways-to-make-your-app-popular/index.md","title":"5 Ways to Make Your App Popular with Shared-State","description":"Users do not quit because your app is bad — they quit because the chain experience gets in the way. Here are 5 ways Shared-State removes that friction and makes your app grow.","date":"2026-02-08T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"Thought Leadership","permalink":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1218/blog/tags/thought-leadership"},{"inline":true,"label":"Key Features","permalink":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1218/blog/tags/key-features"}],"readingTime":1.05,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Push Chain","url":"https://x.com/PushChain","page":{"permalink":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1218/blog/authors/push"},"imageURL":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1218/assets/blog/authors/authorpush.png","key":"push"}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"5-ways-to-make-your-app-popular","title":"5 Ways to Make Your App Popular with Shared-State","authors":["push"],"image":"./cover-image.webp","description":"Users do not quit because your app is bad — they quit because the chain experience gets in the way. Here are 5 ways Shared-State removes that friction and makes your app grow.","text":"Users don\'t quit bad apps. They quit because wallet switches, mismatched balances, and endless approvals get in the way. Shared-State removes those blockers. Here are 5 concrete ways it makes your app feel seamless — and grow.","tags":["Thought Leadership","Key Features"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"What is a Universal AMM? How do Universal Txns Power It?","permalink":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1218/blog/what-is-a-universal-amm"},"nextItem":{"title":"How Universal Fee Abstraction Works","permalink":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1218/blog/how-universal-abstraction-works"}},"content":"![Cover Image of 5 Ways to Make Your App Popular with Shared-State](./cover-image.webp)\\n\\n<!--truncate-->\\n\\nUsers don\'t quit because your app is bad.\\n\\nThey quit because the chain experience gets in the way — switches, mismatched balances, and endless approvals.\\n\\nShared-State removes the burden from your users\' journey.\\n\\nHere are five ways that will make your app go popular.\\n\\n## Way #1 — No Wallet Switching\\n\\nWith Shared-State, your app lives in one global place, not many chain silos.\\n\\nSo users never hop networks; the whole app just works. It feels like entering one big open space instead of checking five different doors.\\n\\n## Way #2 — One-Click Multi-Action\\n\\nOn most chains, simple tasks become multi-step obstacle courses.\\n\\nShared-State turns them into one intent with one signature.\\nUsers love apps that feel like \\"Done,\\" not \\"Next… next… next…\\"\\n\\n## Way #3 — Predictable Liquidity & Quotes\\n\\nChain-by-chain apps show chain-by-chain results.\\n\\nShared-State gives your app one synced source of truth: balances, LP, quotes, all aligned.\\nPredictability = trust → trust = growth.\\n\\n## Way #4 — Universal Identity\\n\\nToday, changing chains feels like changing who you are.\\n\\nShared-State keeps identity in one place: same profile, same activity, same preferences.\\nYour app feels continuous instead of \\"resetting\\" each time.\\n\\n## Way #5 — Universal Contracts\\n\\nInstead of 10 versions of your app living on 10 chains, Shared-State lets you deploy once.\\n\\nEvery feature becomes available to every user instantly: no redeploying, no syncing headaches.\\nConsistency is a growth hack.\\n\\n---\\n\\nApps don\'t become popular by adding more features.\\nThey grow by removing friction.\\n\\nShared-State makes your app feel like one seamless experience, no matter what chain your users come from.\\n\\nBuild once → your users glide.\\n\\nWant to build such universal apps? Or transform your existing app into one?\\nFollow the [quick transformation docs here](https://push.org/docs)\\n\\nExperience Universal Apps: [https://push.org/ecosystem](https://push.org/ecosystem)"},"twitterId":""}');

